"coder_notes":"Pan-cancer molecularly tailored (FoundationOne) vs standard-of-care basket trial; glioblastoma is explicitly eligible in inclusion criterion 8 ('Patients with glioblastomas and high grade malignant gliomas can be enrolled with the historical tissue samples') but conditions list only breast, GI, NSCLC and other cancer. TT-arm drugs are chosen per patient from a fixed list ('one or more drugs'); all coded experimental_combination as several investigational agents are listed in the experimental arm, but individual patients may receive a single drug, hence regimen unclear. Biomarker rows are coded enrichment (TT-arm assignment is by genomic profile) and candidate-matched to the listed drug(s); the generic eligibility requirement is profiling showing no target actionable with approved drugs. SoC comparator registered as unspecified 'Oncology Drugs'."
